Shark Fin Antenna Cover for Car, Automotive Top Roof Aerials AM/FM Radio Signal Base, Vehicle Shark Fin Shape Cover with Adhesive Tape, Car Accessories Universal for Most Sedan, SUV, Van (Carbon)
Widely Applicable This universal shark fin antenna measures and is suitable for most cars on the market. It is only suitable for flat roofs and not for curved roofs. (To ensure proper installation and use after purchase, please check the size of your car's antenna base before placing your order.) Easy to Install 1. Remove the antenna of the original car and wipe clean the side position; 2. Take out the antenna and sticker, and stick the tape on the bottom of the antenna; 3. Tighten the screw of the antenna with a tool;
